  "toolHint": "{id, select, rectangle_select{Drag to select a rectangle. Hold Shift for a square.} move_selected_pixels{Drag the selection to move it. Drag with the right button to rotate it, drag the handles to scale it. Ctrl leaves a copy; the arrow keys nudge it.} lasso_select{Drag to draw the outline of a selection.} move_selection{Drag the selection outline to move it. The pixels stay in place.} ellipse_select{Drag to select an ellipse. Hold Shift for a circle.} zoom{Left-click to zoom in, right-click to zoom out, or drag a box to zoom to it.} magic_wand{Click a color to select the area around it. Hold Shift to select it across the image.} pan{Drag to move the view.} paint_bucket{Left-click fills with the primary color, right-click with the secondary.} gradient{Drag to draw a gradient. Drag the handles to adjust it; press Enter to finish.} paintbrush{The left button paints with the primary color, the right button with the secondary.} eraser{Drag to erase to transparency.} pencil{Draws one-pixel lines without antialiasing.} color_picker{Left-click picks the primary color, right-click the secondary.} clone_stamp{Ctrl+click to set the source, then drag to paint from it.} recolor{Replaces the secondary color with the primary where you paint. Ctrl+click picks a color.} text{Click to place the cursor, then type. Drag the handle or drag with the right button to move the text; press Esc to finish.} line_curve{Drag to draw a line. Drag the handles to bend it; press Enter to finish.} rectangle{Drag to draw a rectangle. Hold Shift for a square.} rounded_rectangle{Drag to draw a rounded rectangle. Hold Shift for a square.} ellipse{Drag to draw an ellipse. Hold Shift for a circle.} freeform_shape{Drag to draw a closed freeform shape.} other{}}",
  "@toolHint": {"placeholders":{"id":{"type":"String"}}},
